To: Mark Brown <broonie@kernel.org>, Geert Uytterhoeven <geert@linux-m68k.org>
Cc: Simon <horms@verge.net.au>, Linux-Renesas <linux-renesas-soc@vger.kernel.org>, Linux-ALSA <alsa-devel@alsa-project.org>
